2) If you could only fix one of these three, which would change your day the most? 
The one I would fix the most is definitely my night schedule. I lose track of time when I am doomscrolling because I usually stop playing video games past 9 PM, and the rest of the time is doomscrolling. At one point, I doomscrolled until almost 2 AM, and I struggled to sleep.

3) Do any two rows share a similar WHY?
Definitely the first two WHYS. Both of them involve me losing track of time due to video games or social media.
